<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="theme-color" content="#0b0c12"><title>Blocksmith — Minecraft plugins</title><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Mono:wght@400;500&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"><link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css"></head>
<body><div class="ambient a"></div><div class="ambient b"></div><header class="topbar"><a class="brand" href="#top"><i>▦</i> block<span>smith</span></a><nav><a href="#plugins">Explore</a><a href="#how">How it works</a></nav><div class="top-actions"><button class="btn quiet" id="loginBtn">Log in</button><button class="btn light" id="signupBtn">Create account ↗</button><button class="avatar hidden" id="userChip"></button><button class="btn quiet hidden" id="logoutBtn">Log out</button></div><button class="menu-toggle">☰</button></header>
<main id="top"><section class="hero"><div class="hero-copy"><div class="eyebrow"><i></i> THE HOME FOR MINECRAFT PLUGINS</div><h1>Build a better<br><span>block by block.</span></h1><p>Discover plugins, share what you make, and turn your server ideas into reality.</p><div class="hero-ctas"><a class="btn lime" href="#plugins">Explore plugins ↓</a><button class="btn outline" id="heroCreate">Create a plugin ✳</button></div><div class="hero-note"><b></b> A growing world of server builders <strong>✦</strong></div></div><div class="hero-art"><div class="orbit"></div><div class="orbit orbit2"></div><div class="cube maincube"><i>▧</i></div><div class="cube smallcube leftcube">✦</div><div class="cube smallcube rightcube">⌘</div><label class="floatlabel fl">PAPER <b>1.21</b></label><label class="floatlabel fr">✳ MADE FOR BUILDERS</label><span class="spark">✧</span></div></section>
<section class="stats"><div><b>8</b><small>DEMO LISTINGS</small></div><div><b>Browser</b><small>LOCAL PREVIEW</small></div><div><b>Preview</b><small>EARLY CONCEPT</small></div><div class="quote">Listings and activity are sample content for this preview.</div></section>
<section class="plugins-section" id="plugins"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">SAMPLE LISTINGS · PREVIEW DATA</div><h2>Find your <span>next favourite.</span></h2></div><button class="btn outline publish-btn">＋ Publish a plugin</button></div><div class="toolbar"><label class="search">⌕ <input id="search" type="search" placeholder="Search plugins, tags, creators..."></label><select id="platform"><option value="all">All platforms</option><option>Paper</option><option>Spigot</option><option>Purpur</option><option>Folia</option><option>Velocity</option></select><select id="version"><option value="all">All versions</option><option>1.21</option><option>1.20</option><option>1.19</option><option>1.18</option></select><select id="sort"><option value="popular">Demo order</option><option value="newest">Recently added</option><option value="name">Name A–Z</option></select></div><div class="category-row"><button class="category active" data-category="all">All listings <small id="listingCount">08</small></button><button class="category" data-category="admin">Admin tools</button><button class="category" data-category="gameplay">Gameplay</button><button class="category" data-category="world">World & builds</button><button class="category" data-category="economy">Economy</button><button class="category" data-category="utility">Utility</button></div><div class="plugin-grid" id="pluginGrid"></div><div class="empty hidden" id="emptyState">No plugins found. Try a different search or filter.</div></section>
<section class="maker-banner" id="how"><div class="maker-art"><div class="ai-orb">✳</div><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class="maker-text"><div class="eyebrow">YOUR IDEA, YOUR PLUGIN</div><h2>Skip the blank page.<br><span>Start with a spark.</span></h2><p>Describe what you want to build. Our AI plugin maker helps turn your idea into a plan, starter code, and next steps.</p><button class="btn lime" id="makerOpen">Try the AI plugin maker ↗</button><small>Early preview · You stay in control of your code</small></div></section><section class="bottom-cta"><div class="eyebrow">MADE BY PLAYERS, FOR PLAYERS</div><h2>Got something <span>good?</span></h2><p>Give your plugin a home. Share it with the people who need it.</p><button class="btn light publish-btn">Publish your plugin ↗</button></section></main>
<footer><a class="brand" href="#top"><i>▦</i> block<span>smith</span></a><span>Build things players remember.</span><small>© 2025 BLOCKSMITH COMMUNITY</small></footer><div class="toast" id="toast"></div>
<dialog id="authDialog" class="dialog"><button class="close" data-close>×</button><div class="eyebrow">JOIN THE COMMUNITY</div><h2 id="authTitle">Welcome back.</h2><p id="authSub">Log in to publish plugins and save your favourites.</p><form id="authForm"><label class="field-label">Email<input id="authEmail" type="email" placeholder="you@example.com" required></label><label class="field-label">Password<input id="authPassword" type="password" placeholder="At least 8 characters" minlength="8" required></label><label class="field-label hidden" id="handleField">Username<input id="authHandle" type="text" placeholder="BlockBuilder" minlength="2"></label><button class="btn lime full" id="authSubmit">Log in ↗</button></form><div class="switch-auth" id="authSwitch"></div><div class="demo-note">Demo account flow for this preview. A live site needs a secure account service.</div></dialog>
<dialog id="publishDialog" class="dialog wide"><button class="close" data-close>×</button><div class="eyebrow">SHARE WITH THE COMMUNITY</div><h2>Publish a plugin.</h2><p>Give builders the details they need to get started.</p><form id="publishForm" class="form-grid"><label class="field-label span-two">Plugin name<input name="name" required placeholder="e.g. Better Backpacks"></label><label class="field-label">Category<select name="category"><option value="utility">Utility</option><option value="admin">Admin tools</option><option value="gameplay">Gameplay</option><option value="world">World & builds</option><option value="economy">Economy</option></select></label><label class="field-label">Platform<select name="platform"><option>Paper</option><option>Spigot</option><option>Purpur</option><option>Folia</option><option>Velocity</option></select></label><label class="field-label">Minecraft version<input name="version" placeholder="1.21.x" required></label><label class="field-label">Plugin link<input name="url" type="url" placeholder="https://..." required></label><label class="field-label span-two">Short description<textarea name="description" rows="3" required placeholder="What does your plugin do?"></textarea></label><button class="btn lime span-two">Submit plugin ↗</button></form><div class="demo-note">Preview only: submissions are saved in this browser. Add a backend before launching publicly.</div></dialog>
<dialog id="makerDialog" class="dialog wide"><button class="close" data-close>×</button><div class="eyebrow">✳ AI PLUGIN MAKER · EARLY PREVIEW</div><h2>What are we building?</h2><p>Describe your idea and get a practical plugin outline to start from.</p><label class="field-label">Your plugin idea<textarea id="ideaInput" rows="4" placeholder="A plugin that lets players create teams, claim a shared base, and invite friends..."></textarea></label><div class="maker-options"><label>Server type<select id="makerPlatform"><option>Paper</option><option>Spigot</option><option>Purpur</option><option>Folia</option></select></label><label>Minecraft version<select id="makerVersion"><option>1.21</option><option>1.20</option><option>1.19</option></select></label></div><button class="btn lime full" id="generateBtn">✳ Generate my plugin plan</button><div class="maker-result hidden" id="makerResult"></div><div class="demo-note">This preview generates a starter plan in your browser. Connecting a real AI model requires a secure server-side API.</div></dialog><script src="app.js"></script></body></html>
